snippet.description:
As a woman once told me....."Derrs Bearz in dem der woods!"  I was remembering her while activating Great Smoky Mountains National Park, US-0034 late one evening.  The good news is I survived. I deployed my SS-25 on the Buddy Coil and did great on 20m and 40m.  In fact, I had to got QRT leaving a huge pileup behind.  You'll see in the video how quickly it gets dark once the sun starts down.
